<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt" class="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'media' }</script>
  <title>Sessão do WhatsApp</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-black text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 min-h-screen transition-colors duration-500 overflow-x-hidden">

  <main class="max-w-lg mx-auto p-6 md:py-12">
    <header class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black">Sessão do WhatsApp</h1>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm">Carrega aqui a sessão emparelhada para não teres de parear outra vez.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/admin" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors">← Início</a>
    </header>

    <div class="p-6 border-2 border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900">
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
        Estado actual: <strong class="<%= estado.ligado ? 'text-green-500' : 'text-amber-500' %>"><%= estado.ligado ? 'emparelhado' : 'pareado' %></strong>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">Pasta no servidor: <code class="text-zinc-300"><%= pasta %></code></p>

      <form method="POST" action="/admin/sessao" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="mt-5 space-y-4">
        <input type="file" name="ficheiros" multiple required
               class="block w-full text-sm text-zinc-400 file:mr-4 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:bg-zinc-900 file:px-4 file:py-2 file:text-xs file:font-bold file:uppercase file:tracking-wider file:text-zinc-300" />
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Escolhe <strong>todos</strong> os ficheiros .json dentro de <code>auth_info</code> (<code>creds.json</code>, <code>pre-key-*.json</code>, <code>session-*.json</code>, <code>sender-key-*.json</code>).</p>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors">Enviar sessão</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 p-6 border-2 border-amber-500/50 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-amber-500">Depois de enviar</p>
      <ol class="mt-2 list-decimal list-inside text-sm text-zinc-400 space-y-1">
        <li>Vai ao Render e faz <strong>Restart</strong> (ou Manual Deploy) no serviço.</li>
        <li>Espera o log dizer <em>"Xitike conectado ao WhatsApp."</em></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-500">Estes ficheiros dão controlo total da conta. Não os partilhes nem os commites no GitHub.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
